docs/_build/

# ISOLDE parameterisation output: running a "Parameterise" action writes a
# generated OpenMM force-field XML (<ligand>.xml, <ligand>_metal.xml, ...) into
# the working directory. These are regenerable run artifacts, never committed.
# Anchored + non-recursive, so it only catches these top-level drops and never the
# tracked force fields under src/openmm/amberff/.
/*.xml
